# Superseded versions and temporary worktrees
archive/
code/.worktrees/

# Scores, raw agent output and debate drafts: keeps blind reviewers blind and the map about the product
docs/reviews/
docs/runs/
docs/ITERATION_LOG.md
docs/TEST_REPORT.md
business/model/

# The map itself and dependency or build output
graphify-out/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/coverage/
**/*.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/package-lock.json

# Secrets and local state
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.DS_Store
